  "description": "* * * VIEWING NOW * * *\n\nFair Deal Property New Homes Division Your Trusted Partners for Residential Property Sales\n\nAre delighted to present to you for sale this semi-detached A-rated home located in the highly regarded Ard Rua Meadows development in Claremorris part of new development of consisting of 26 newly built A Rated homes.\n\nThese beautifully designed two-bedroom plus office semi-detached residences represents a compelling opportunity for buyers seeking modern, energy-efficient living within reach of Galway City.\n\nPositioned within what is rapidly emerging as a key satellite location for Galway, Claremorris offers a powerful combination of connectivity, lifestyle, and value. For buyers currently navigating the highly competitive Galway City market, Ard Rua Meadows provides the opportunity to secure a substantially larger, high-specification home without compromise.\n\nExtending to approximately 90 square metres, this home has been thoughtfully laid out to maximise both space and natural light, delivering a modern living environment ideally suited to family life.\n\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises a bright and welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living room, and an impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area designed for everyday living and entertaining. A separate utility room and guest WC complete the ground floor.\n\nUpstairs, the property features two well-proportioned double bedrooms, including a generous mater bedroom with en-suite, along with a fully fitted family bathroom. There is also a smaller office room which could also accommodate a cot.\n\n\nThe home is finished to a high standard throughout, with a turnkey specification that includes a fully fitted kitchen, contemporary bathrooms and en-suite, quality tiling, laminate flooring, and full internal painting, allowing purchasers to move in with ease and confidence.\n\nA key feature of this property is its A2 energy rating, achieved through modern construction methods and a highly efficient air-to-water heat pump system with underfloor heating at ground floor level. This ensures excellent comfort, lower running costs, and a future-proofed home aligned with modern energy standards.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking along with front and rear gardens that are levelled and seeded, providing a clean and practical outdoor space ready for immediate use.\n\nArd Rua is a mature and well-established residential development, known for its family-friendly environment, generous green areas, and strong sense of community. Ideally located just 1.5 kilometres from Claremorris town centre, the development also benefits from close proximity to primary and secondary schools, as well as childcare facilities within approximately one kilometre.\n\nClaremorris itself continues to gain traction as a strategic commuter town serving Galway City, offering buyers the opportunity to secure high-quality homes in a well-serviced location while avoiding the constraints and pricing pressures of the city market.\n\nThis is exactly the type of opportunity that resonates with today’s informed buyer, more space, better specification, and stronger long-term value.\n\nIf you are currently searching in Galway City and finding yourself limited on space or budget, These stunning A Rated semi-detached homes represents a smart and compelling alternative.\n\nBrought to you by Fair Deal Property New Homes Division Your Trusted Partners for Residential Property Sales",
